Alembic migrations for the Telegram OSINT Bot.

Generate a new revision after changing models:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Apply migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

The database URL is read automatically from your .env via migrations/env.py.
For SQLite (the default), the bot also auto-creates tables on first run, so
migrations are only strictly required when using PostgreSQL in production.
